# INVWIN9.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the location tree
# at level 1 (READER), which is read-only.  New location is grayed in
# the Locations menu; ENTER shows a location's contents, whose ESC goes
# back to the tree; CTRL+E, INS and DEL are each refused with INV's
# permission message, DEL without asking first, and the Record menu
# shows Move grayed; ESC goes back to the item list.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWIN9.SNP is its snapshot.
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER
K ALT-L
S MENU
K N
S GRAYED
K ESC ESC ALT-L B
S LOCS
K ENTER
S CONTENTS
K ESC CTRL-E
S NOEDIT
K ENTER INS
S NONEW
K ENTER DEL
S NODEL
K ENTER ALT-C
S NOMOVE
K ESC ESC
S BACK
K ESC
S ITEMS
